        {
          "id": "d1-r1",
          "question": "D1. The tiled softmax below is wrong. Find the bug, fix it, state the test that catches it.",
          "answer": "Bug: l = l + lb drops the rescale. Fix: track m_new first, then l = l exp(m-m_new) + lb exp(mb-m_new). Test: two-pass reference on blocks with different maxima.",
          "anchor": "d1-p01"
        }
      ],
