          "id": "s1-r1",
          "question": "S1. SRAM is infinite. Redesign attention: what happens to the loops, the (m,l) notebook, and the traffic?",
          "answer": "Loops collapse to a single pass; (m,l) needed only if streaming, else plain softmax; traffic drops to one read of Q,K,V and one write of O. Tile only for occupancy.",
